==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*4 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*6 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is optimized for Lv.13 units. If you struggle, it may be worth waiting for earlier stages to become available and clearing those first. Players who challenge this stage later than expected only need several meatshields, one-two good critical hitters and one or more area attackers who outrange the Condemned Pengs. Then spamming (with good money management early on) gets the job done.

